        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\n*** 3 BEDROOM / 1 BATHROOM MID-TERRACE HOME *** REGISTER YOUR INTEREST TODAY ***\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this well-presented three-bedroom, one-bathroom mid-terrace home to the rental market, ideally located in the highly sought-after Palmerstown Woods development, Clondalkin, Dublin 22.\r\nThis bright and spacious property offers well-proportioned living accommodation throughout. The accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room, a fully fitted kitchen with ample storage, three generously sized bedrooms, and a main bathroom.\r\nThe property offers comfortable living in a mature and well-established residential development, making it an ideal home for a wide range of tenants. With bright interiors and generous living space throughout, this home is sure to appeal to those seeking convenience and comfort in an excellent location.\r\nPalmerstown Woods enjoys an excellent location close to Clondalkin Village, Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, and Palmerstown, with a superb range of shops, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets,\r\n\r\n\r\nparks, and leisure facilities all within easy reach. The area is well served by excellent public transport links, while the N4, N7, M50, and major road networks provide quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to secure a well-located home in one of Dublin 22's most convenient residential developments. Early interest is highly recommended.\r\n \r\nAdditional Features:\r\n3 Bed / 1 Bath mid-terrace home\r\nBright and spacious living accommodation\r\nThree generously sized bedrooms\r\nFully fitted kitchen with ample storage\r\nMain family bathroom\r\nMature and well-established residential development\r\nExcellent transport links with easy access to the N4, N7, M50, and Dublin City Centre\r\nClose to Clondalkin Village, Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, and a host of local amenities\r\nRegister your interest today\r\n \r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS EMAIL ENQUIRIES ONLY / NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT-HAND SIDE AND CLICK SEND MESSAGE WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE."
